  "descriptionMarkdown": "My friend didn't like how our first platform looked square in space, so he launched me the challenge to build a platform in form of Enterprise ! ... And voila ...\n\n- This platform can be build right after basic space sciences are done.\n- Asteroid collectors will filter and collect specific types of asteroids only if they are missing on the sushi belt.\n- Sushi belt is half used for the ressources and other half for the ammunition.\n- Asteroid processing is producing just enough what is needed for the fuel processing and ammo creation.\nIn some specific case, if the ammo production can't keep up and gets low on belts, fuel production will stop, platform will slow down, so that ammo production can catch up, and get back to speed when ready.\n\nPlatform weight is 610 tons with storage space for 240 stacks of items and can achieve max speed of 146km/s \n\nIt can be used for any activity between Nauvis, Vulcanus, Fulgora, and Gleba.\n\nEnjoy ! ;-)",
